<para>RocksDB integration: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>store<sp/>=<sp/>makeRocksDBRotationStore(&amp;rocksdb_wrapper);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">scheduler.initialize(3600,<sp/>std::move(store));</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
