    <briefdescription>
<para>Key rotation scheduler for automatic key rotation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Features:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Schedule-based rotation (e.g., every 90 days)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Zero-downtime rotation process</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Notification on rotation completion</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Thread-safe operation</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Optional persistent state via <ref refid="classthemis_1_1plugins_1_1user__storage_1_1_i_rotation_store" kindref="compound">IRotationStore</ref> (last_check_ms survives restart)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Optional persistence via <ref refid="classthemis_1_1plugins_1_1user__storage_1_1_i_rotation_store" kindref="compound">IRotationStore</ref> (Feature 3)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Rotation Process:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Create new container with new key</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Copy data from old to new container</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Atomically switch containers (rename)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Keep old container as backup</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Notify administrators </para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
